    "detailed_description": "SPACE DUDES vs ALIEN DUDES<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlien Dudes are attacking the Base, It's up to the Space Dudes to Stop Them !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay Across Many Maps and Game Modes to Win the Day !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can View it in 1st or 3rd Person Mode.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGo it Alone or Team up with Your A.I. Squad.<br />\r\n(Don't forget to set the Number of BOTS in the Main Menu)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUp to 16 Members on Each Team.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can set the Challenge Level of the Enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSeveral Game Modes, Including . . .<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTEAM DEATHMATCH<br />\r\nKill the Enemy Team Members to Get Points<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCAPTURE THE FLAG<br />\r\nGet the Enemy Flag and Bring it back to Your Base<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCONQUEST<br />\r\nControl the Objectives over Time<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRUSH<br />\r\nDestroy or Defend the Objectives<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKILL CONFIRMED<br />\r\nCollect Enemy Dogtags to earn points<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFREE FOR ALL<br />\r\nKill Everyone Else<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere are some more of the gameplay features and content You can expect . . .<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- You and Your team of A.I. BOTS can battle the Aliens in many different Game Mode Types<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 1st or 3rd Person View Mode<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- You can set the Number of BOTS in the Main Menu<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Up to 16 Members on Each Team.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- You can set the A.I. Level of the Enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Challenge Yourself in the Following Game Types . . .<br />\r\nTEAM DEATHMATCH, CAPTURE THE FLAG, CONQUEST, RUSH, KILL CONFIRMED and FREE FOR ALL",
